{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b533f375-d54f-8272-a4c4-a88f4d86ab0d",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:55:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, I got a parking ticket and I want to, hmm, let me see, I want to fight it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What was it for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Snow parking ban. Which, fine, there's a ban, but that street was never plowed. Never. And it wasn't posted either, no sign, nothing. I looked. I mean, I walked up and down it after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no plow came through and you didn't see any signs. Got it. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hold on. Hmm. It's, uh, it's on the windshield, I mean I took it off the windshield, it's in my hand. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then the main thing is that appeals go in writing. Put your reasons down, include the ticket number, your plate, and any photos you took of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did take photos, actually. Okay. So where do I send it? Is it an email, or, no, a mailing address, I'd rather mail it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can mail it or drop it at City Hall, addressed to the parking violations office. I'll give you the mailing line so you can write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, I've got a pen. Well, hang on, let me find paper. Okay. Wait, my neighbor, he keeps this garden spotless, even now in March, everything trimmed, and meanwhile my street looks like nobody cares. Anyway. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Address it to City of Newport, Parking Violations, c/o City Hall, 43 Broadway, Newport, Rhode Island 02840."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-three Broadway. Okay. Got it. And there's a deadline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a window printed on the ticket. Check it today, because you don't want to lose on timing when you've got a good argument."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, yeah, okay. I'll look. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Good luck with it."
    }
  ],
